abstract: "Offline, dependency-free command-line audit of a Persian/Arabic .docx for places where the order a reader sees depends on bidirectional rules or the renderer: left-to-right paragraphs and tables, number chains such as ۲-۳, signs before digits, stray direction controls. Writes an explicit fix to a copy."
